    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nCaptivating and intriguing from first glance, this exceptional detached family home exudes warmth, character and timeless appeal. Occupying a generous site of approximately 0.54 acres, the property enjoys a tranquil setting with breathtaking\nviews of the Glen of Aherlow and the majestic Galtee Mountains, offering the perfect balance of privacy, space and modern family living.\n\nBeautifully presented throughout, this unique residence extends to approximately 201.45 sq. m (2,169 sq. ft.) of bright, versatile accommodation. An abundance of windows floods the home with natural light, creating an inviting atmosphere while framing the stunning surrounding landscape and taking full advantage of the spectacular mountain views. \n\nThoughtfully designed with family living in mind, the\nspacious layout offers flexibility to suit a variety of lifestyles.\nThe accommodation comprises four generously proportioned bedrooms with one ensuite, complemented by well-appointed reception rooms and a large ground-floor study, providing the ideal space for those working from home, a playroom or an\nadditional family room. An attached garage offers excellent additional storage options.\n\nApproached via a sweeping private driveway with extensive off-street parking, the attractive bay-fronted façade, contemporary blue-rendered exterior and mature landscaped gardens create an impressive first impression. The expansive grounds provide superb outdoor space for family life and entertaining, while the elevated position allows the property to fully embrace its exceptional outlook over the Glen of Aherlow towards the iconic Galtee Mountains.\n\nImmaculately maintained and full of charm and interesting character, this outstanding home seamlessly blends contemporary living with a warm and welcoming atmosphere. This is a rare opportunity to acquire a truly special family home with uninterrupted views of the beautiful Galtee Mountains.\n\nProperty Features\n• Exceptional detached family home extending to 201.45 sq. m (2,169 sq. ft.) \n• Generous 0.54-acre site with mature landscaped gardens \n• Four spacious bedrooms plus a large ground-floor study/home office \n• Breathtaking views of the Glen of Aherlow and the Galtee Mountains \n• Bright, light-filled accommodation with an abundance of windows throughout \n• Attached garage and extensive private driveway with ample off-street parking \n• Immaculately presented throughout with versatile family living space \n• Peaceful countryside setting combining privacy with modern family living"
      },
